{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42398","headline":"送德迈道人之豫章 · 徐铉","name":"送德迈道人之豫章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅灵桥畔落残花，桥上离情对日斜。\n顾我乘轩慙组绶，羡师飞锡指烟霞。\n楼中西岭真君宅，门外南州处士家。\n莫道空谈便无事，碧云诗思更无涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}